issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.4.beta1, 4.4.rc1, 4.4.rc2\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10, DirectX, 64GB Ram, Nvidia RTX 4090\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen trying assign a bunch of (already loaded) icons to an `OptionButton` (in this case its around ~700 32x32 icons) `RenderingDeviceDriverD3D12::DescriptorsHeap::allocate` sometimes fails with\n```\nCreateDescriptorHeap failed with error 0x8007000e.\n```\nWhich indicates OOM and then continues to spam that error for quite a while. However this only happens on DirectX not on Vulkan and loading the textures spread over multiple frames also works without issue. It also only sometimes happens and the test scene I have is pretty static in terms of loaded textures and general memory consumption. GPU and System memory also never even come close to the limit.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n```GDScript\nvar options := OptionButton\nfor item in items:\n  var next_idx := options.get_item_count()\n  options.add_icon_item(item.icon, item.text, item.id)\n  options.set_item_metadata(next_idx, item)\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n-","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repo